  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven equation: 34 + 43 − 17 ÷ 121 × 11 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after ‘+’ and ‘−’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged:\n\n34 + 43 − 17 ÷ 121 × 11 = ? ⇒ 34 - 43 + 17 × 121 ÷ 11 = ?\n\n⇒ 34 - 43 + 17 × __**121 **____**÷**____** 11**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 34 - 43 + __**17 **____**× **____**11**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**34 + 187**__ - 43 = ?\n\n⇒ __**22**____**1 - 43**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 178 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
